OL,3,C'A lovely, kind and brilliant man':
OL,4,CTens of thousands attend Jason Arday
OL,5,Cvigil
OL,7,FFriends and campaigners spoke
OL,8,Fpassionately about the events leading
OL,9,Fto the death of the academic, and the
OL,10,Fmedia scrutiny following accusations
OL,11,Fof plagiarism.
OL,13,FOne friend said Jason Arday told him
OL,14,Fhe felt he was being "hounded to
OL,15,Fdeath," as ITV News Senior
OL,16,FCorrespondent John Ray explains
OL,18,FMore than 30,000 people attended a
OL,19,Fvigil in central London on Monday
OL,20,Fevening in honour of former Cambridge
OL,21,FUniversity Professor Jason Arday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/15
