OL,3,C'A lovely, kind and brilliant man':
OL,4,CTens of thousands attend Jason Arday
OL,5,Cvigil
OL,7,FProf Arday was found dead in his South
OL,8,FLondon home last week after a period
OL,9,Fof intense public scrutiny following
OL,10,Fallegations of plagiarism.
OL,12,FFlowers were laid at the foot of
OL,13,FNelson's Column in Trafalgar Square,
OL,14,Fas tens of thousands paid tribute in a
OL,15,Fvigil organised by campaign group
OL,16,FStand Up To Racism.
OL,18,FFriends and politicians delivered
OL,19,Fspeeches, as people chanted, "I am
OL,20,FProfessor Jason Arday".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
