PN,30503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1787042885
OL,3,C'A lovely, kind and brilliant man':
OL,4,CTens of thousands attend Jason Arday
OL,5,Cvigil
OL,7,FDiane Abbott MP said she had seen the
OL,8,Fprofessor a few days before he died.
OL,10,F"He was always a lovely, kind and
OL,11,Fbrilliant man, but you felt a week ago
OL,12,Fthat the vicious campaign against him
OL,13,Fwas beginning to get to him," she said.
OL,15,FShe said she believes a "vicious media
OL,16,Fcampaign drove him to his death".
OL,18,F"He must have felt that if he resigned
OL,19,Fthe attacks on him would stop, but in
OL,20,Ffact they got even worse.
OL,26,@zD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
