SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1787042885
OL,3,C'A lovely, kind and brilliant man':
OL,4,CTens of thousands attend Jason Arday
OL,5,Cvigil
OL,7,F"From his resignation to his suicide
OL,8,Flast week, was just three weeks, but
OL,9,Fthe newspapers printed 249 articles
OL,10,Fabout him," Abbott said.
OL,12,F"This was a vicious campaign but it
OL,13,Fwasn't just a campaign against the
OL,14,Fprofessor, it was a campaign against
OL,15,Fall of us and that's why it is so
OL,16,Fimportant to come together and fight
OL,17,Ffor justice for Professor Jason
OL,18,FArday," she added.
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@AOUzD@GO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/15
