OL,3,C'A lovely, kind and brilliant man':
OL,4,CTens of thousands attend Jason Arday
OL,5,Cvigil
OL,7,F"There needs to be some justice," said
OL,8,FLord Simon Woolley, a friend of the
OL,9,Fprofessor, who described the media
OL,10,Fcoverage of Prof Arday as a "public
OL,11,Fexecution".
OL,13,FAged 37, Prof Jason Arday became the
OL,14,FUniversity of Cambridge's youngest
OL,15,Fblack professor. He was scrutinised
OL,16,Fover allegations that he copied other
OL,17,Facademics' works and embellished
OL,18,Fpersonal stories.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
