OL,3,C'A lovely, kind and brilliant man':
OL,4,CTens of thousands attend Jason Arday
OL,5,Cvigil
OL,7,FArday resigned on August 5 after the
OL,8,Funiversity said it would launch an
OL,9,Finquiry into the academic's
OL,10,Fqualifications and honourary
OL,11,Fappointments following "new
OL,12,Finformation".
OL,14,FAt the time Arday said his resignation
OL,15,Fwas not "an acceptance of the
OL,16,Fnarratives that have surrounded me",
OL,17,Fbut was "simply the decision of
OL,18,Fsomeone who has reached the limits of
OL,19,Fwhat any person should reasonably be
OL,20,Fexpected to endure".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
