OL,3,C'A lovely, kind and brilliant man':
OL,4,CTens of thousands attend Jason Arday
OL,5,Cvigil
OL,7,FIn an interview with the BBC, the
OL,8,Funiversity's chancellor Lord Chris
OL,9,FSmith of Finsbury said: "I do believe
OL,10,Fit is possible to hold to two
OL,11,Fprinciples at the same time: to
OL,12,Fbelieve in the importance of academic
OL,13,Fintegrity, and where criticisms of
OL,14,Fplagiarism arise, about any academic,
OL,15,Fwhoever they are, ensure that they are
OL,16,Frigorously investigated.
OL,18,F"And also to refuse to join in a
OL,19,Fracist feeding frenzy over a
OL,20,Fparticular academic."
OL,26,@qD@YOUzD@AOU|D@UO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/15
