OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1787042885
OL,3,C'A lovely, kind and brilliant man':
OL,4,CTens of thousands attend Jason Arday
OL,5,Cvigil
OL,7,FProf Arday's publisher, Simon &
OL,8,FSchuster UK, issued a statement last
OL,9,Fweek about his death, which said:
OL,10,F"Jason was subjected to a campaign of
OL,11,Fsustained abuse for more than three
OL,12,Fyears since he accepted the role of
OL,13,Fprofessor at Cambridge University by
OL,14,Fthose who would leave no stone
OL,15,Funturned in their quest to undermine
OL,16,Fhim.
OL,18,F"The campaign of misinformation was
OL,19,Ftoo much for Jason, who was a gentle
OL,20,Fman and who always wanted to see the
OL,21,Fbest in everyone.
OL,26,@rD@AOUzD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
