OL,3,C'A lovely, kind and brilliant man':
OL,4,CTens of thousands attend Jason Arday
OL,5,Cvigil
OL,7,F"We are in shock to have lost this
OL,8,Famazing father, partner, brother,
OL,9,Funcle and son."
OL,11,FSpeaking at the vigil, Bell Ribeiro-
OL,12,FAddy, MP for Clapham and Brixton Hill
OL,13,Fwhere Prof Arday lived, read out words
OL,14,Ffrom his family.
OL,16,FThey said: "This has been an
OL,17,Fincredibly painful time for our
OL,18,Ffamily, and we are still coming to
OL,19,Fterms with the tragic loss of our
OL,20,Fbeloved Jason.
OL,26,@oD@AOUxD@LOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30511
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1787042885
OL,3,C'A lovely, kind and brilliant man':
OL,4,CTens of thousands attend Jason Arday
OL,5,Cvigil
OL,7,F"What has become clear over the past
OL,8,F72 hours is the profound impact he had
OL,9,Fon people. We are grateful to all who
OL,10,Fhave created light in this dark time
OL,11,Fthrough kindness, generosity and
OL,12,Fsolidarity.
OL,14,F"Your presence here to remember him
OL,15,Fthis evening means a lot to us, and
OL,16,Fwhile we cannot be there in person,
OL,17,Fplease know that we stand with you in
OL,18,Fspirit.
OL,26,@oD@AOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30512
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1787042885
OL,3,C'A lovely, kind and brilliant man':
OL,4,CTens of thousands attend Jason Arday
OL,5,Cvigil
OL,7,F"The public cruelty Jason was
OL,8,Fsubjected to was too much for any man
OL,9,Fto bear. The outpouring of love,
OL,10,Fsupport and grief since his death mean
OL,11,Fso much to us.
OL,13,F"Although it is bittersweet, now
OL,14,Fkindness is needed in life, not just
OL,15,Fin death. We'll never know what might
OL,16,Fhave been different had he experienced
OL,17,Fmore of it while he was still here."
OL,19,FDawn Butler MP apologised to the
OL,20,Fprofessor and his family for their
OL,21,Floss.
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@AOUyD@dO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
