OL,3,C'A lovely, kind and brilliant man':
OL,4,CTens of thousands attend Jason Arday
OL,5,Cvigil
OL,7,F"I'm sorry because I think we let him
OL,8,Fdown... I'm sorry we could not protect
OL,9,Fhim," she said.
OL,11,F"Now is the time for unity. Now is the
OL,12,Ftime for us to ensure we have
OL,13,Fsustainable change. Now is the time to
OL,14,Fbring down the systems that don't
OL,15,Fprotect us," she added.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/15
