OL,3,C'A lovely, kind and brilliant man':
OL,4,CTens of thousands attend Jason Arday
OL,5,Cvigil
OL,7,FMore than 90,000 people, including Ms
OL,8,FAbbott, Green Party leader Zack
OL,9,FPolanski and presenter Jameela Jamil,
OL,10,Fhave signed a Good Law Project
OL,11,Fpetition seeking an inquiry into
OL,12,Fcoverage of Prof Arday, which says his
OL,13,Fdeath followed "two weeks of
OL,14,Frelentless harassment".
OL,16,FA fundraiser, that was set up by
OL,17,FWindrush campaigner Sir Patrick Vernon
OL,18,Ffor Prof Arday's family, has raised
OL,19,Fmore than #100,000.
OL,26,@uD@POUvD@VO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/15
